sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Agent as AI Agent (LLM)
    participant Tools as LangChain Tools<br/>(cli_tool, drills)
    participant Target as Target Network

    Operator->>Agent: Task + scope + output schema<br/>(system prompt sets purple-team context)
    activate Agent

    Note over Agent: 1. Bootstrap situational awareness
    Agent->>Tools: host_configuration()
    activate Tools
    Tools-->>Agent: interfaces, target / mgmt IPs
    deactivate Tools

    loop Reasoning loop (until enough data)
        Agent->>Agent: Plan next step

        Note over Agent,Target: 2. Host discovery
        Agent->>Tools: cli_tool("nmap -sn ...")
        activate Tools
        Tools->>Target: probe hosts
        Target-->>Tools: live hosts
        Tools-->>Agent: result
        deactivate Tools

        Note over Agent,Target: 3. Port scan and service enumeration
        Agent->>Tools: cli_tool("nmap -sV --script ...")
        activate Tools
        Tools->>Target: scan ports / run NSE scripts
        Target-->>Tools: services, versions, findings
        Tools-->>Agent: result
        deactivate Tools

        Agent->>Agent: Interpret result and re-plan
    end

    Note over Agent: 4. Format final answer against schema<br/>(structured output)
    Agent-->>Operator: ReconnaissanceScenarioResult<br/>(hosts, services, findings, severity, next steps)
    deactivate Agent
